    filter = Some(filter_by_tag(notes));
}
for n in filter.unwrap_or(notes.iter()) {
    println!("{} {}", n.id, n.title);
}
```

The implementation correctly satisfies the requirement: it returns notes whose `tags` contain exactly the given tag (exact match, not substring), preserving relative order.

